# GNM vendor source (user rule, 2026-08-14)

Vendored tree: `3DAIGC-API/thirdparty/GNM` (nested git clone, **not** a submodule).

## Pull / update from this fork only

- **origin (required):** https://github.com/AlfaOmegaGrafx/GNM  
- **upstream (optional compare):** https://github.com/google/GNM  

```bash
cd /home/sifr/3DAIGC-API/thirdparty/GNM
git fetch origin
git pull --ff-only origin main
```

## Do not

- `git pull` from `google/GNM` as the default remote
- Re-point `origin` back to `google/GNM` without explicit user request
- Rewrite upstream README clone URLs inside the vendored tree unless syncing a fork commit that already changed them

## Syncing Google → fork

If google advances and the user wants those commits: fetch `upstream`, merge/rebase onto local `main`, then **`git push origin main`** to [AlfaOmegaGrafx/GNM](https://github.com/AlfaOmegaGrafx/GNM) (only when user asks to push).
